    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"Hockey Game Prediction\"\nauthor: \"Julian Fitz\"\nformat: html\n---\n\n## Setup\n\nSet the variables\n\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\n# url for the composite schedule (ONLY WORKS WITH USCHO (1/20/2026))\n# url <- \"https://www.uscho.com/scoreboard/division-i-women/20252026/composite-schedule/\"\nurl <- \"https://www.uscho.com/scoreboard/division-i-men/20252026/composite-schedule/\"\nhome_team <- \"St. Lawrence University\"\naway_team <- \"Quinnipiac University\"\n```\n:::\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n# Outcome Prediction\n\n\n\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}\n\n```\nProbability of St. Lawrence University win:  0.02756388 \n```\n\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}\n\n```\nSt. Lawrence University Expected Goals:  1.583893 \n```\n\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}\n\n```\nProbability of Quinnipiac University win:  0.8876717 \n```\n\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}\n\n```\nQuinnipiac University Expected Goals:  6.106541 \n```\n\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}\n\n```\nProbability of a tie:  0.03758455\n```\n\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n:::\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nthrowaway_home_df <- ratings_plot |> filter(FullName == home_team) |> mutate(Team = FullName)\n\nthrowaway_away_df <- ratings_plot |> filter(FullName == away_team) |> mutate(Team = FullName)\n```\n:::\n\n\n# Power / Ability\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n![](Win-Probability_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-15-1.png){width=960}\n:::\n:::\n\n\n# Goalie Stats\n\n## Identifying performance of goalie relative to teams\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n![](Win-Probability_files/figure-html/GSAA vs SVPrct-1.png){width=672}\n:::\n:::\n\n\n**St. Lawrence University Goalies**\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"reactable html-widget html-fill-item\" id=\"htmlwidget-d2bacf717fabc01f5b7c\" style=\"width:auto;height:auto;\"></div>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-d2bacf717fabc01f5b7c\">{\"x\":{\"tag\":{\"name\":\"Reactable\",\"attribs\":{\"data\":{\"Rk\":[51,82,107],\"Name\":[\"Mason Kucenski\",\"Collin Winn\",\"Cam Smith\"],\"Age\":[23,21,23],\"GP\":[14,9,4],\"SVPrct\":[0.873,0.883,0.919],\"W\":[2,0,1],\"L\":[11,7,2],\"GA\":[55,37,13],\"SV\":[379,278,148],\"SOG\":[434,315,161],\"TIME\":[812,493,241],\"GSAA\":[-9.83,-4.215,3.757],\"relative_save_prct\":[-0.019,-0.009,0.027]},\"columns\":[{\"id\":\"Rk\",\"name\":\"Rank\",\"type\":\"numeric\"},{\"id\":\"Name\",\"name\":\"Name\",\"type\":\"character\"},{\"id\":\"Age\",\"name\":\"Age\",\"type\":\"numeric\"},{\"id\":\"GP\",\"name\":\"Games Played\",\"type\":\"numeric\"},{\"id\":\"SVPrct\",\"name\":\"Save %\",\"type\":\"numeric\"},{\"id\":\"W\",\"name\":\"Wins\",\"type\":\"numeric\"},{\"id\":\"L\",\"name\":\"Losses\",\"type\":\"numeric\"},{\"id\":\"GA\",\"name\":\"Goals Allowed\",\"type\":\"numeric\"},{\"id\":\"SV\",\"name\":\"Saves\",\"type\":\"numeric\"},{\"id\":\"SOG\",\"name\":\"Shots on Goal\",\"type\":\"numeric\"},{\"id\":\"TIME\",\"name\":\"Time On Ice\",\"type\":\"numeric\"},{\"id\":\"GSAA\",\"name\":\"Goals Saved Above Average\",\"type\":\"numeric\"},{\"id\":\"relative_save_prct\",\"name\":\"Relative Save Percent\",\"type\":\"numeric\"}],\"dataKey\":\"afa1cd1609d1b2137e88db89d704a11a\"},\"children\":[]},\"class\":\"reactR_markup\"},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n**Quinnipiac University Goalies**\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"reactable html-widget html-fill-item\" id=\"htmlwidget-2f9383fa1611b6dbee59\" style=\"width:auto;height:auto;\"></div>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-2f9383fa1611b6dbee59\">{\"x\":{\"tag\":{\"name\":\"Reactable\",\"attribs\":{\"data\":{\"Rk\":[31,84,153],\"Name\":[\"Matej Marinov\",\"Dylan Silverstein\",\"Sam Scopa\"],\"Age\":[22,21,20],\"GP\":[18,9,1],\